[
    {
        "content": "<p>I worked a couple years at Amazon in the late 2000's on the AmazonFresh team. We were the first team to ever write software that allowed Amazon to route its own truck fleet. The AmazonFresh grocery delivery service never really took off, but it laid a lot of groundwork for the ubiquitous trucks that you see on the road now (at least in the US).</p>\n<p>I never worked specifically on the truck routing algorithms, but this year I felt a fit of nostalgia and tried to see what Claude could come up with. This is it: <a href=\"https://roc.lynrummy.com/delivery/\">https://roc.lynrummy.com/delivery/</a></p>",
        "id": 642674137,
        "sender_full_name": "Steve Howell",
        "timestamp": 1795362242
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>It runs a slightly tweaked version of the Clarke/Wright savings algorithm. It has some hacks for Bellevue and Medina related to racing variations of the algorithm against each other. For those not familiar with the Seattle Area (where we piloted the service), they are two suburbs that were near the fulfillment center (aka warehouse). The grocery delivery manager had to often re-route our algorithm's results (Seattle has a lot of water!), and he used certain neighborhoods for overflow.</p>",
        "id": 642674344,
        "sender_full_name": "Steve Howell",
        "timestamp": 1795362386
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>This is written mostly in Roc, of course. The UI is a little raw, but you can read the key in the top right corner. It's obviously a very simplified version of the actual problem, but I think any Seattle residents will recognize the geography! If you have Seattle connections, DM me here!</p>",
        "id": 642674473,
        "sender_full_name": "Steve Howell",
        "timestamp": 1795362477
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The map is still drawn with TypeScript, but all the heavy lifting is in Roc. The original Claude-written version was pure TypeScript.</p>",
        "id": 642674605,
        "sender_full_name": "Steve Howell",
        "timestamp": 1795362563
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Here's a taste of the code:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"CoffeeScript\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c1\">## An edge's speed factor (lower is faster), in roadgraph.ts's order of</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">## checks: 520's lake span, Montlake and I-5, the 405 bypass, bridges, the</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">## city, the suburbs.</span>\n<span class=\"nv\">factor</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">U8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">U8</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nx\">Surface</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Bridge</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">F64</span>\n<span class=\"nv\">factor</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">kind</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nv\">montlake</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Seattle</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">node_of</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"Montlake\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nv\">issaquah</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Seattle</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">node_of</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"Issaquah\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nv\">redmond</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Seattle</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">node_of</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"Redmond\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nv\">medina</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Seattle</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">medina</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">montlake</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">medina</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">or</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">medina</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">montlake</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nx\">speed_bridge520</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">montlake</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">or</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">montlake</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nx\">speed_i5</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Seattle</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">is_i5_exit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">a</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">or</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Seattle</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">is_i5_exit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nx\">speed_i5</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">issaquah</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">redmond</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">or</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">redmond</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">issaquah</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nx\">speed_fast</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nx\">match</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">kind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"nx\">Bridge</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">speed_bridge</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"nx\">Surface</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Seattle</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">is_west</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">a</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">or</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Seattle</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">is_west</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                </span><span class=\"nx\">speed_city</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                </span><span class=\"nx\">speed_suburb</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 642674685,
